ivate(...)"},{"t":"text","text":". If a consumer only needs one exposed property, it can say"},{"t":"text","text":" "},{"t":"text","text":"so:"}]},{"t":"code","lines":[{"tokens":[{"text":"const","kind":"keyword"},{"text":" "},{"text":"tasks"},{"text":" "},{"text":"=","kind":"keyword"},{"text":" "},{"text":"yield*","kind":"keyword"},{"text":" TaskList.","kind":"punctuation"},{"text":"tasks","kind":"function"},{"text":"();","kind":"punctuation"}]}],"filename":"","language":"typescript","numbered":false,"firstLine":1},{"t":"paragraph","children":[{"t":"text","text":"The dependency graph then records that only "},{"t":"code","text":"tasks"},{"t":"text","text":" was used — which makes"},{"t":"text","text":" "},{"t":"text","text":"tests smaller, and is why "},{"t":"link","href":"/craft/learn/10-testing","external":false,"children":[{"t":"text","text":"step 10"}]},{"t":"text","text":" is short."}]},{"t":"heading","level":2,"id":"what-you-gained","children":[{"t":"text","text":"What you gained"}]},{"t":"paragraph","children":[{"t":"text","text":"Component-owned state now lives in a named, injectable and testable service —"},{"t":"text","text":" "},{"t":"text","text":"no "},{"t":"code","text":"@Injectable"},{"t":"text","text":", no constructor. Reusable per-call logic can use the "},{"t":"code","text":"function"},{"t":"text","text":" "},{"t":"text","text":"scope and compose other services without owning a shared instance."}]},{"t":"row","layout":"between","children":[{"t":"paragraph","children":[{"t":"link","href":"/craft/learn/02-derive","external":false,"children":[{"t":"text","text":"← 2. Derive instead of duplicate"}]}]},{"t":"paragraph","children":[{"t":"link","href":"/craft/learn/04-compose","external":false,"children":[{"t":"text","text":"4. Compose services →"}]}]}]}],"outline":[{"level":2,"id":"from-the-component-to-craftservice","text":"From the component to craftService"},{"level":2,"id":"using-it","text":"Using it"},{"level":2,"id":"picking-a-scope","text":"Picki